    <!-- Instructions -->
    <string name="instructions_title">Instructions</string>
    <string name="instructions_how">Choose a topic, then a layer. Play as a pair or in a small group, passing the phone around. Answer honestly: there are no right or wrong answers, just your truth.</string>
    <string name="instructions_layers" tools:ignore="PluralsCandidate">The deeper the layer, the closer the questions get: at some point they stop being about you alone and start being about the person in front of you. When a question says “me”, it means whoever just read it out. And if a question is too much, pass it: passing counts as an answer too. You get %1$d passes per layer.</string>
    <string name="instructions_timer" tools:ignore="PluralsCandidate">The %1$d-second timer is not a time limit, but a minimum reflection time: you have to wait for the countdown to hit zero before moving on to the next question.</string>

